<section class="section section--pad" aria-labelledby="operator-role-heading">
  <div class="panel panel--soft">
    <div class="trg-editable" data-trg-editable>
      <div class="trg-editable__fallback">
        <h2 id="operator-role-heading" class="heading-lg">Build the Role Around Your Operation</h2>
        <p class="body-md">A focused inquiry helps clarify what your equipment needs and how support may fit your operation.</p>
        <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">01</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment to be Operated</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Identify the vehicles or equipment involved, including make and model where available. Explain their role in your snow-removal operation and any equipment-specific requirements.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">02</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Tasks &amp; Operating Areas</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Describe the work to be carried out and the areas involved. Share site access requirements, operating conditions and the responsibilities associated with the role.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">03</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Team &amp; Responsibilities</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Outline how the operator role fits with your current personnel. Identify supervision, communication and coordination requirements that need to be discussed.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">04</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Timing &amp; Availability</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Provide the site location, anticipated dates and any scheduling requirements. Confirm the scope and availability of support as part of your inquiry.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trg-editable__cms">
        <squarespace:block-field id="equipmentOperatorsRole" columns="12" label="EDIT: Build the Role Around Your Operation" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

